@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Supplier Offer History

DEVELOPER OWNER: UNASSIGNED — Team assignment required
MODULE: Supplier Portal
TRELLO TASK: None — no dedicated Trello card
TRELLO URL: —

PURPOSE:
Show the revision history of the supplier’s own offers.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Supplier (own company only, Admin-approved)

ROUTE: /Supplier/Offers/History/{id?}

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Own bids grouped by TenderInvitation, ordered by
  RevisionNumber.

DEPENDENCIES:
Bids, TenderInvitations.

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.

IMPORTANT:
Every query must be filtered by the signed-in user’s
SupplierId. Never show other suppliers’ invitations, offers,
prices or evaluations.
===========================================================
*@
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Supplier Offer History";
    ViewData["WorkspaceSection"] = "My Offers";
    ViewData["Description"] = "All revisions of your offers.";
}
<partial name="_PageHeader" />
<partial name="_ScaffoldNotice" />

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel" aria-labelledby="tbl-revisions">
    <div class="pg-panel-head"><h2 id="tbl-revisions">Revisions</h2></div>
    <div class="pg-table-wrap">
        <table class="pg-table">
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Tender</th><th scope="col">Revision</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Created</th><th scope="col">Submitted</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td colspan="5"><partial name="_EmptyState" model='"No offer revisions yet."' /></td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>
